# #419: File -> New Level, then "+" (a new world) in the new level. Layout of the 1920x1080 checklist run
# (tools/headless/reference/checklist.png) with startup_level levels/smoke_level.desc: menu bar File at (19,30),
# the "+" next to the world tab at (86,75). The scene is clean at the start, so New Level asks nothing.
# The editor logs "Created a new level" and "Created world 'world2'" (tools/headless/check_log.sh reads them).
sleep 1
shot headless_out/new_level_world/00_start.png
click 19 30
sleep 1
shot headless_out/new_level_world/01_file_menu.png
click 40 52
sleep 4
shot headless_out/new_level_world/02_new_level.png
click 86 75
sleep 1
shot headless_out/new_level_world/03_plus_popup.png
type world2
key Return
sleep 4
shot headless_out/new_level_world/04_world2.png
